  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> are three&nbsp;unit vectors, then sum of all possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
