  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />Taking dot with <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> also <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (from given equation)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> or <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />So, if <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br />or if <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
